OL,3,GNEWSADrug dealer caught after 130mph
OL,4,Achase jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug dealer who caused serious
OL,7,Finjuries to a taxi driver after
OL,8,Fcrashing into his vehicle during a
OL,9,Fhigh-speed police chase has been
OL,10,Fjailed.
OL,12,FJames Johnson reached speeds of more
OL,13,Fthan 130mph weaving through traffic as
OL,14,Fhe tried to evade officers on the A1(M)
OL,15,Fnorthbound on 28 August.
OL,17,FThe 31-year-old was caught after
OL,18,Fcrashing into a taxi near the junction
OL,19,F44 exit for Tadcaster, with 10kg of
OL,20,Fcocaine found in his Audi A3.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
