OL,3,GNEWSADrug dealer caught after 130mph
OL,4,Achase jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohnson, of Harding Court in Liverpool,
OL,7,Fwas jailed for eight years at York
OL,8,FCrown Court on Friday, having
OL,9,Fpreviously pleaded guilty to possession
OL,10,Fof cocaine with intent to supply,
OL,11,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous
OL,12,Fdriving and driving without a licence
OL,13,For insurance.
